to bring Patrisse on

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:16.709
to talk about the amazing work
she's been doing for so long

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:19.479
-I understand, Ramy, obviously
it is hard to promote anything

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:24.818
in these times, but your sho
does deal with heavier issue

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:27.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
than maybe most sitcoms
