umbrella,

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:54.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
there are a lot of forms
of anti-blackness that go on

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:58.118
You know, like, white people are
definitely the best at racism.

00:01:58.118 --> 00:02:01.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, they're doing it on,
like, a professional,

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:02.755 line:92%
you know, like, NBA level.

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:05.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I do think that there ar
other groups in there

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:06.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
