"Oh, you guys are --

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:08.528 size:84% position:42%
You're playing, like,
some EuroLeague racism.

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:10.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, you wish you could
be in the NBA."

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:14.901
And I really feel like calling
that out in our own community.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:16.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
So for me looking at it,
of course,

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:19.205 align:start size:94% position:6%
in my own communities wher
the anti-blackness is,

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:22.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, you know, as much as we
can really look at that

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:23.076 size:78% position:39% line:92%
and examine ourselves

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:25.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
instead of making the argument
really binary.

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:28.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, Patrisse, you started
Black Lives Matter

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:31.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
