of Trayvon Martin.

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:33.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
And obviously,
what we're seeing, you know,

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:37.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
this week and last week
is violence is still happening

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:40.093 size:78% position:39%
